<title>UK: GSI sets warrants on Elektrowatt.</title>
<headline>GSI sets warrants on Elektrowatt.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued three million American-style call warrants, on Elektrowatt bearer shares, lead manager The Goldman Sachs Group said.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    550 CHF		   PREMIUM	15.9 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     5.55 CHF		  GEARING	9.5 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 07.JAN.96-20.APR.98   PAYDATE	06.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  522 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
